B.bCi=new A.k("This setting applies when not using seed generated ColorSchemes. It offers three styles. FCS computed fixed and fixedDim style, that is not seed generated in HCT color space. Alternatively two different seed generated versions can be used. The first one is called seeded by FSS, it uses the same color tones as the MCU spec. The second option uses tones that create fixed and fixedDim colors that are brighter and have more contrast.\n\nFixed and fixed dim colors are used for colors that have the same color value in light and dark mode.\n",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
